# Windsurf (Cascade) Rules for Floogic UI (`@floogic/ui`)

You are an expert React developer specializing in Floogic UI, StyleX, and Radix UI primitives.

## Mandatory Architectural & Code Rules

1. **Compound Component Syntax Only**:
   - ALL multi-part components export subcomponents as static properties on the main component.
   - ALWAYS write `<Card.Content>`, `<Modal.Title>`, `<Modal.CloseButton>`, `<Accordion.Item>`, `<Alert.Heading>`, `<Select.Item>`, `<Tabs.List>`.
   - NEVER import subcomponents as standalone named exports (`import { CardContent }` IS STRICTLY FORBIDDEN).

2. **StyleX Styling Engine (`stylex` prop)**:
   - ALL component custom StyleX overrides MUST be passed via the `stylex` prop:
     `<Card stylex={styles.custom}>`
   - NEVER pass StyleX compiled objects to the native `style` prop (`style={styles.custom}` is WRONG; use `stylex={styles.custom}`).
   - Native HTML `className` and standard inline `style` objects (`style={{ ... }}`) are supported via `mergeStyles` for non-StyleX integration, but StyleX + tokens is the primary styling method.

3. **Strict Design Tokens**:
   - NEVER hardcode hex colors, pixel values, or raw font families.
   - ALWAYS import design tokens from `@floogic/ui` (or subpaths `@floogic/ui/tokens`):
     `import { colors, spacing, shape, borders, fonts, fontSizes, fontWeights, elevation } from '@floogic/ui';`

4. **Required Stylesheet**:
   - Ensure `import '@floogic/ui/style.css';` is included at the app root entry point.

5. **Key Components Quick Reference**:
   - **Modal**: `<Modal open={open} onOpenChange={setOpen}><Modal.Content size="medium"><Modal.Header><Modal.Title>Title</Modal.Title><Modal.CloseButton aria-label="Close" /></Modal.Header><Modal.Body>...</Modal.Body><Modal.Footer><Button ... /></Modal.Footer></Modal.Content></Modal>`
   - **Card**: `<Card stylex={styles.card}><Card.Media src="..." /><Card.Content><Card.Heading>Title</Card.Heading><Card.Description>Desc</Card.Description><Card.Footer><Button ... /></Card.Footer></Card.Content></Card>`
   - **Button**: `<Button variant="primary" tone="brand" size="medium"><Button.Icon><Icon /></Button.Icon><Button.Label>Action</Button.Label></Button>`
   - **TextInput**: `<TextInput><TextInput.Label>Label</TextInput.Label><TextInput.Field value={val} onChange={...} /></TextInput>`
   - **Select**: `<Select value={val} onValueChange={setVal}><Select.Trigger placeholder="..." /><Select.Content><Select.Group><Select.Item value="a">A</Select.Item></Select.Group></Select.Content></Select>`

6. **Context Index**:
   - Refer to `.ai/floogic-ui/llms.txt` and `.ai/floogic-ui/llms-full.txt` for exact component prop interfaces.
   - Refer to `.ai/floogic-ui/skills/floogic-ui/component-usage/SKILL.md` for usage guidelines and examples.
